Subject: Select original animated camera playback with bounded native services

Upstream-base: 9ca59d250587adc0436d08176bec3898aa790fa0

Compile original interpolation/cuts, transforms, timing and FOV independently
of the full camera factory. Native owners retain decoded data and provide
presentation flags, simulation time and focal-distance output explicitly.
Validate sample indices, deltas and look-at inputs before unsafe arithmetic.
Raw registry/loading and gameplay service singletons remain unselected.

